Emerald 3DS changes to pret/pokeemerald 76463dac15cad36aca5e2b3f6366abf9e53f814f: Korean port texts
Applies after 0062-korean-title-version-banner.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py.

Korean build only (GAME_LANGUAGE == LANGUAGE_KOREAN): the messages the port adds
(modern EXP Share, IVs/EVs, move category, repel prompt, field HMs from the Bag,
local wireless) in Korean, as two-byte Hangul codes.

